Attackers exploit **introspection queries** to enumerate schema:
```graphql
{
  __schema {
    types {
      name
    }
  }
}
```
Tools like **GraphQLmap** automate attacks:
```bash
graphqlmap -u https://api.example.com/graphql -q '{ users { email password } }'
```
Real-world impact: **2021 Shopify breach** via exposed GraphQL flaws. Mitigation:
- **Disable introspection** in production.
- **Rate-limiting** (WAF rules in Cloudflare).

